   "turn": 2,
   "text": "월별로 나눠서 반응기별 묶은 막대로 바꿔 주세요.",
   "calls": [
    {
     "reply": "To fulfill the request, I need to calculate the pass rate (percentage of A and B grades) for each reactor in each month. The standard chart keys do not support calculating a percentage per group relative to the total count of that group directly from raw category data. Therefore, I will use `data_code` to:\n1. Extract the month from the date column.\n2. Calculate the pass rate for each Reactor-Month combination.\n3. Create a DataFrame with columns suitable for plotting: Month, Reactor, and Pass Rate.\n\nThen, I will plot this as a grouped bar chart (`bar`) with `x` as Month, `y` as Pass Rate, and `by` as Reactor.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"file\": \"data/run_log.xlsx\",\n  \"sheet\": \"런로그\",\n  \"chart\": \"bar\",\n  \"x\": \"월\",\n  \"y\": {\n    \"col\": \"합격률(%)\",\n    \"agg\": \"mean\"\n  },\n  \"by\": \"반응기\",\n  \"data_code\": \"df['월'] = pd.to_datetime(df['일자']).dt.month\\npass_counts = df[df['등급'].isin(['A', 'B'])].groupby(['월', '반응기']).size().reset_index(name='pass_n')\\ntotal_counts = df.groupby(['월', '반응기']).size().reset_index(name='total_n')\\nsummary = total_counts.merge(pass_counts, on=['월', '반응기'], how='left').fillna({'pass_n': 0})\\nsummary['합격률(%)'] = summary['pass_n'] / summary['total_n'] * 100\\ndf = summary\",\n  \"asks\": [\n    {\n      \"ask\": \"월별 반응기별 합격률 계산\",\n      \"how\": \"code\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ask\": \"월별로 나눠서 묶은 막대\",\n      \"how\": \"key\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
